## B. Design DNA

Create a dedicated section called "Design DNA".

This section should explain the visual design in a way that is useful to a developer learning and applying design principles.

Include:

1. Primary design style.
2. Secondary or overlapping design styles.
3. Short description of the style.
4. What the style means.
5. Common associations and emotional tone.
6. Design vocabulary.
